        "icon": "shield",
        "body": "<p>MAISON AMIIR, operated by M/s. Amire Parfum, respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information.</p><p><em>Last Updated: 17 November 2026</em></p><p><strong>1. Data We Collect</strong><br>We collect your name, contact details (email address and phone number) and shipping address to process and fulfil your orders and to provide customer support. Payment information is entered on, and handled by, our payment gateway.</p><p><strong>2. How We Use Your Data</strong><br>Your personal information is used only to:</p><ul>\n<li>Process and ship your orders</li>\n<li>Send order updates and tracking links via WhatsApp, SMS or email</li>\n<li>Provide customer support</li>\n<li>Send newsletters and offers, if you have subscribed</li>\n<li>Improve your website experience</li>\n</ul><p><strong>3. Secure Storage</strong><br>All payment details are encrypted and processed securely through trusted payment gateways. We do not store your card or UPI details on our servers.</p><p><strong>4. Third-Party Services</strong><br>We work with our e-commerce platform provider, trusted payment gateways and courier partners to run our website and deliver your orders. These partners have their own privacy policies governing use of your data.</p><p><strong>5. Cookies</strong><br>Cookies may be used to enhance your browsing experience on our website. You may disable cookies through your browser settings.</p><p><strong>6. Your Rights</strong><br>You may contact us at info@maisonamiir.com to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data. You may also contact our Grievance Officer, whose details are given in our Terms &amp; Conditions.</p><p><strong>7. Governing Law</strong><br>This Privacy Policy is governed by the laws of India, including applicable data protection laws.</p>"
